*> vybe-test: cobol/string_advanced/test_string_with_pointer
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_string_advanced.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SRC PIC X(5) VALUE "WORLD".
01 WS-DST PIC X(11) VALUE "HELLO      ".
01 WS-PTR PIC 9(2) VALUE 7.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    STRING WS-SRC DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO WS-DST WITH POINTER WS-PTR.
    DISPLAY WS-DST.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-DST DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO WORLD"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO WORLD] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-PTR.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-PTR DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "12"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [12] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

